            "heading": "Description",
            "content": "<p>The AutoLinkr GapGuard™ is a sleek, universal seat gap filler that blocks the space between your car seat and center console — preventing phones, keys, coins, cards, and anything else from disappearing into that impossible-to-reach gap.<\/p><p>It slides into place in under 10 seconds with zero tools and fits virtually any car. The non-slip material keeps it locked in position so it never shifts while you drive.<\/p><p>Clean, minimal design that blends into any interior. Stop fishing around under your seat — GapGuard just solves the problem permanently.<\/p>",
