            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Compatibility",
            "content": "<p>Universal fit — designed to work with the vast majority of cars, trucks, and SUVs.<\/p><ul><li>Fits standard seat-to-console gaps (1–3 inches)<\/li><li>No tools or installation required<\/li><li>Flexible material conforms to most gap shapes<\/li><li>Works with heated seats and seat adjustment mechanisms<\/li><\/ul>",
